stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SignedOut
  SignedOut --> Authenticating: email/username/password or OAuth
  Authenticating --> SignedOut: failure
  Authenticating --> SignedIn: verified Supabase session
  SignedIn --> Home: redirect /home
  SignedIn --> Chat: bearer token
  Chat --> Chat: TanStack and FastAPI verify same token
  Chat --> SignedOut: 401
  SignedIn --> SignedOut: supabase.auth.signOut + clear provider token
